              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If your trucks are not moving, you are not earning. That is why Florida fleet owners look for truck service in Florida that is fast, reliable, and clear about timelines.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International builds every service interaction around uptime, from certified technicians to a wide range of in-stock parts and mobile support. Our goal is simple. Get you in, get it done right, and get you back on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-you-get",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What You Get with Sun State International Service",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-you-get"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-what-you-get-1",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Diamond Edge Certified Service Centers: our shops meet International's Diamond Edge standards for speed and quality, reducing dwell time and improving communication at every step"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Certified, factory-trained technicians: more than 60 certified techs handle everything from preventive maintenance to complex diagnostics for all makes and models"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Convenient Florida coverage: service and parts support in Tampa, Davenport, and Sarasota, with clearly posted hours for quick scheduling"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Mobile maintenance and after-hours options: select locations offer after-hours coverage through Certified Fleet from 8:00 PM to 5:00 AM"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-you-get-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Need a repair plan now? Contact Sun State International to schedule service or request a callback.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-lower-tco",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida Fleet Maintenance That Lowers Total Cost of Ownership",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "lower-tco"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-lower-tco-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fleet managers measure partners by impact on total cost of ownership. Solid preventive programs reduce unplanned stops, protect fuel economy, and keep your CSA scores clean. No matter if you're running a small operation or a large fleet, every hour of avoided downtime matters. Our service department includes:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-lower-tco-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Quick check-in and consistent updates so your drivers are not waiting on answers"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Preventative maintenance programs aligned to OEM intervals for International and all makes"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Safety-first inspections that catch issues before they turn into road calls"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Documentation you can use for compliance and warranty follow-up"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-lower-tco-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "These are the basics Florida fleets expect from fleet truck service in Florida. Our team delivers them with a hospitable, straightforward approach that respects your time.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-parts-availability",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Parts Availability That Keeps Repairs Moving",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "parts-availability"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-parts-availability-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even the most well-maintained truck stalls without the right part. Sun State International's parts department carries over $3 million in inventory with access to over 1 million unique parts, including OEM International and proven aftermarket options. If it is not on the shelf, we source it fast. What this means for you:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-parts-availability-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Fewer multi-day waits for common wear items"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "One counter for all-makes fleets, from filters and brakes to HVAC and electrical"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Account options that streamline repeat purchases"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Local pickup across multiple Florida locations to reduce travel time"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
